d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740177/1abc3c3a-018a-429d-9b27-2fc6cf343e4d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740177/1abc3c3a-018a-429d-9b27-2fc6cf343e4d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"🏡 Furnished 2-Room Apartment for Temporary Rent in Rotenburg (Wümme)\nWe are offering our bright, fully furnished 2-room apartment on the first floor for temporary rent. The apartment is fully equipped for two adults (and a toddler).\n📅 Rental period: Available now until 15 December 2026 🏠 Living space: approx. 69 m2 🏢 First floor with elevator 🛏️ 2 rooms 🛁 Bathroom with window and barrier-free shower 🌿 Large balcony on the quiet side of the property 🚗 1 private parking space 🚲 Covered bicycle parking ♨️ Central hot water supply 🌡️ Underfloor heating 📶 Wi-Fi included in the rent\n📍 Location & Mobility\nThe apartment is located on the quiet side of the property. Two large double French doors lead directly onto the spacious balcony. From the balcony, you can enjoy both sunrises and sunsets.\nJust across the street, you can reach the Wümmeniederungen nature reserve on foot, which is ideal for walks and spending time outdoors.\nAlso within easy walking distance, just across the street, are the Ronolulu leisure pool, a REWE supermarket, and two bakeries.\nSeveral other supermarkets, including Lidl, Aldi and Edeka, as well as Famila and ROSSMANN, can easily be reached by bicycle.\nFor your convenience, a trekking bike and a Thule bicycle trailer are available. A floor-standing bicycle pump is also provided.\nThe apartment is approximately 10 minutes from the train station. Rotenburg (Wümme) has excellent regional train connections to Bremen and Hamburg, with direct trains to both cities and no change required.\nThe nearest airport is Bremen Airport, approximately 50 km from Rotenburg (Wümme).\n\n🏠 Open-Plan Living & Kitchen Area\nThe apartment has a spacious open-plan living and kitchen area with several separate functional zones. The windows are equipped with roller shutters.\n🛋️ Living Area\nThree-seater sofa, two seats with reclining function\nReclining armchair\nShelving unit\nElectronic piano\nCajón\nReading lamp\nRug\n🍽️ Dining Area\nDining table with chairs\nHigh chair for children\n🍳 Kitchen Area\nFully equipped fitted kitchen with:\nBosch dishwasher\nInduction hob and oven\nRefrigerator and freezer\nCooking and baking utensils for everyday use\nCrockery, cutlery and drinking glasses\nThermomix TM6\nWMF Lumero espresso maker\nWaste bin\nWindow above the sink\nFood-storage containers made of glass, metal and plastic\n💻 Workspace\nDesk\nChair\nFloor lamp\nDrawer cabinet\nBrother printer, scanner and copier\nBasic office supplies\n\n🛏️ Bedroom\nSolid cherry wood bed\nExtra-large mattress: 2.00 × 2.20 m\nTwo extra-large duvets:  \nDown duvet\nCamel-hair duvet\nBed linen for the extra-large duvets\nOptional bed guard\nAdditional mattress: 90 × 200 cm\nAdditional duvet for the second mattress\nBed linen for the additional duvet\n3 pillows\nSolid oak wardrobe\nSolid beechwood drawer cabinet\nSolid oak chest of drawers\nBedside lamp\nBlackout curtains on all three windows\n\n🚿 Bathroom\nBarrier-free shower\nToilet\nWashbasin\nMirror\nWindow with roller shutter and pleated blind\nStorage shelf\nDrawer cabinet\nBaby changing area\n\n🧹 Household & Equipment\nMiele vacuum cleaner\nLG ThinQ washing machine\n2 clothes drying racks\nIroning board\nIron\nBasic cleaning supplies\nBasic selection of tools\nHousehold step ladder\n\n🌿 Balcony\nLarge balcony\nTwo large double French doors leading to the balcony\nBalcony table and chairs\nBalcony lighting\nPossibility to dry laundry on the balcony\n\n🏘️ Inclusive Residential Community\nThe apartment is located in an inclusive residential community, where people with and without disabilities live together.\nA shared community room is available for joint activities, social gatherings and encounters.\n\n💰 Rent\nRent: €860 per month Additional costs: €290 per month Total: €1,150 per 31-day rental period\nThe rent must be paid before moving in and before any additional rental days. After each 31-day period, payment for the next rental period is due.\n✅ Electricity included ✅ Wi-Fi included\nThe apartment is rented exclusively for the specified temporary rental period.\nMinimum rental period: 30 days\nIf you are interested, we would be happy to receive a short message including a few details about yourself and your preferred rental period.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"69"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":115000,"deposit":0,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1150.00","deposit":"0.00","agencyFee":"0.00","e